          "citation_status": "supported",
          "note": ""
        },
        {
          "text": "The counter notice will be published in redacted form, and GitHub may provide a complete unredacted copy to any party whose rights would be affected.",
          "support_status": "supported",
          "citation_status": "supported",
          "note": ""
        },
        {
          "text": "GitHub is not the judge and exercises little discretion beyond determining whether notices meet the DMCA's minimum requirements.",
