          "citation_status": "supported",
          "note": ""
        },
        {
          "text": "For DMCA, copyright owners are expected to investigate and expressly include forks in their takedown notice.",
          "support_status": "supported",
          "citation_status": "supported",
          "note": ""
        },
        {
          "text": "If, at the time the notice was submitted, all existing forks of the repository were identified, GitHub would process a valid claim against all forks in that network at the time it processes the notice, given the likelihood that newly created forks would contain the same content.",
