        {
          "text": "For customers or prospective customers, the policy lists as acceptable: swag; economy class airfare to GitHub offices for Executive Briefings; bleacher-type tickets to a sporting event; a reasonably priced dinner in town; and a small box of chocolates as an end-of-year thank you.",
